  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education and training in Human Rights 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Centre for Human Rights 2020-2021. Capacity building and education within human rights for human rights defenders, civil society, government officials and academia. Main geographical focus in South East Asia, but covers countries in all regions.The main areas are: human rights education, rule of law, freedom of religion or belief, human rights and business, equality and non-discrimination, human rights mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
